    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd0f\u00a0<strong>Got Your Nose!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this nose-talgic journey, you play as <strong>Sniffer</strong>, a runny nose with snotty legs and toes. <strong>Sneeze, sniff, and snot</strong> through the strange sewers of <strong>Scentropolis</strong> to restore order one smell at a time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc43 <strong>A Nose Like No Other</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this <strong>quirky</strong> adventure, <strong>oxygen is your lifeline</strong> and <strong>snot is your greatest weapon</strong>. Zoom through with snot, sniff flowers for hidden powers, and <strong>use every breath to survive</strong> a sewer full of bizarre critters and silly surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135980/extras/aa9c473c6f657cd0eb435b8f81c1ae7a.avif?t=1755431011\" data-has-big width=800 height=225 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135980/extras/830bfb4586875d0b55b75c2630a70084.poster.avif?t=1755431011\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135980/extras/830bfb4586875d0b55b75c2630a70084.webm?t=1755431011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135980/extras/830bfb4586875d0b55b75c2630a70084.mp4?t=1755431011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca8 Your <strong>breath</strong> is more than air, it's your<strong> fuel.</strong> Manage <strong>oxygen</strong> carefully and <strong>sneeze</strong> your way through deep sewer tunnels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83c\udf1f\u00a0<strong>Master</strong> the art of <strong>breathing</strong> by overcoming challenges one <strong>inhale and exhale</strong> at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3b Sniff out <strong>flowers and scents</strong> that restore air, unlock <strong>special powers</strong>, or reveal <strong>hidden pathways.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135980/extras/7f92b4d98744a1da76561e9d15766713.avif?t=1755431011\" data-has-big width=800 height=225 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135980/extras/d0732cae231cc25cbcfe3e4b564190d7.poster.avif?t=1755431011\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135980/extras/d0732cae231cc25cbcfe3e4b564190d7.webm?t=1755431011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135980/extras/d0732cae231cc25cbcfe3e4b564190d7.mp4?t=1755431011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udee7 <strong>Experience snot-powered platforming!</strong> Bounce, stick, and glide through levels using <strong>Sniffer\u2019s snotty abilities.</strong> Every obstacle becomes a playground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135980/extras/46a86622a4f322aeb10a47f870362b46.avif?t=1755431011\" data-has-big width=800 height=225 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc0c Meet the oddball residents of <strong>Scentropolis</strong>, from sewer critters in trouble to silly allies with stories of their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf06 <strong>Explore scent-sational levels</strong> filled with humor, secrets, and the occasional suspicious smell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca1 <strong>Smells Like Home</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nasal Nomad: Sniffer\u2019s Delight</strong> is designed for anyone who loves a good twist. Easy to pick up for younger players, but with enough challenge and secrets to keep seasoned platformer fans hooked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Family Friendly Fun</strong>\u00a0- Lighthearted humor, colorful worlds, and quirky characters make this platformer perfect for players of all ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc43\ud83d\udca8 <strong>Smell Ya' Later</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Do you have the nose for it?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Wishlist Nasal Nomad: Sniffer\u2019s Delight today</strong> and prepare to sniff, bounce, and be part of the smelliest adventure on <strong>Steam</strong>. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: right\"><strong><i>\u201cEvery sneeze echoes a tale. Bless you!</i></strong><br><strong>~ Sniffer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135980/extras/b216285ba49bf03f7a1391252874419e.avif?t=1755431011\" data-has-big width=800 height=111 /></span></p>",
